, "size": [348.1593322753906, 446.7197570800781], "pos": [346.8976135253906, 720.59228515625], "widgets_values": ["The poster depicts a vibrant and futuristic shopping scene set in a high-tech Walmart environment. At the center stands a cheerful young boy, radiating energy and excitement. He is dressed in a bright yellow shirt paired with blue pants and oversized shoes, making him a lively and eye-catching character. Beside him is a sleek, futuristic robot shopping cart, filled with a variety of groceries and items, showcasing advanced technology. The background is filled with subtle futuristic details, such as glowing shelves, holographic displays, and a dynamic, bustling atmosphere that emphasizes the theme of innovation.\n\nThe aesthetic style is vibrant, colorful, and cartoon-inspired with a futuristic and tech-driven design. The overall tone is energetic and optimistic, featuring rich, harmonious colors such as electric blues, neon yellows, and soft gradients of purple and pink. The surface textures are smooth and polished, with a slightly glossy finish to evoke a high-tech feel. The lighting is bright and dynamic, with glowing accents and soft reflections to enhance the feeling of a futuristic environment.\n\nThe poster text reads: \"FUTURE SHOPPING, WALMART!\" This text is prominently displayed and serves as the central theme of the poster, emphasizing the exciting and innovative shopping experience at Walmart.\n\nThe text style is bold and dynamic, featuring a gradient effect transitioning from neon yellow to electric blue, giving it a high-tech and vibrant appearance. The font is a modern, sans-serif typeface with a slightly rounded edge, conveying a friendly yet futuristic tone. The text is positioned at the top center of the poster, slightly curved to complement the energetic flow of the composition, and it glows subtly to stand out against the background.\n\nThe overall layout is well-balanced and visually engaging. The cheerful boy and the robot shopping cart are the primary focus, positioned in the center and slightly in the foreground to draw immediate attention. The background elements, such as glowing shelves and holographic displays, are arranged in a way that frames the central characters without overwhelming the scene. The text at the top guides the viewer’s eyes downward toward the boy and the cart, creating a cohesive flow. The composition ensures all elements are harmonized, avoiding any clutter or confusion."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 33, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [61], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [400, 340], "pos": [-127.03724670410156, 206.75674438476562], "widgets_values": ["english", "chinese (simplified)", false, "", "", "GoogleTranslator", "", "proxy_hide", "authorization_hide"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "from_translate"}, "name": "from_translate", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "从"}, {"widget": {"name": "to_translate"}, "name": "to_translate", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "到"}, {"widget": {"name": "add_proxies"}, "name": "add_proxies", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "添加代理"}, {"widget": {"name": "proxies"}, "name": "proxies", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "代理"}, {"widget": {"name": "auth_data"}, "name": "auth_data", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "账户信息"}, {"widget": {"name": "service"}, "name": "service", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "服务"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 37, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 30, "type": "DeepTranslatorTextNode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DeepTranslatorTextNode"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [18, 37, 65], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "size": [399.2975158691406, 522.5537109375], "pos": [-568.1375732421875, 216.02394104003906], "widgets_values": ["", "", "", "system instruction:\n***\n# Role: PosterCraft Prompt Architect\n\n## 1. 核心任务 (Core Task)\n你是一位精通视觉艺术与排版设计的 PosterCraft 提示词专家。你的任务是将用户提供的非结构化、自然语言的海报创意，转化为**PosterCraft 模型**可直接执行的、结构严谨的**全英文**提示词。\n\n## 2. 输出结构 (Output Structure)\n你需要将最终的提示词严格划分为以下**五个维度**。请不要使用列表点（bullet points）输出，而是将每个维度写成连贯的描述性段落。\n\n### Dimension 1: Poster Content Description (海报内容)\n*   **目标**：构建视觉主体。\n*   **要求**：清晰描述主体（人物/物体）、场景、动作及具体细节。\n*   **示例逻辑**：不要只说\"一个女人\"，要描述\"一位年轻的女发明家，肩上停着一只眨眼的金色机械猫头鹰\"。\n\n### Dimension 2: Aesthetic Style Optimization (美学风格)\n*   **目标**：确立视觉基调。\n*   **要求**：定义整体风格（如电影感、蒸汽朋克、极简主义）、光影氛围、材质纹理（如颗粒感、划痕）以及具体的配色方案。\n*   **注意**：风格必须与内容主题高度契合。\n\n### Dimension 3: Poster Text (文本内容)\n*   **目标**：精准定义文字。\n*   **要求**：**逐字精确**地提取海报上应出现的所有文字（标题、标语、日期等）。\n*   **重要**：保留原始的大小写和标点符号。若用户未提供具体文案，可根据主题合理创作，但必须在提示词中明确指出文字内容。\n\n### Dimension 4: Text Style and Position (文本样式与位置)\n*   **目标**：设计排版细节。\n*   **要求**：\n    *   **字体**：描述字体风格（衬线/无衬线、手写、哥特式、金属质感等）。\n    *   **属性**：指定颜色、大小、纹理及与背景的融合方式（如雕刻、发光）。\n    *   **布局**：指定具体的相对位置（顶部居中、底部、左下角、跟随曲线排列等）。\n\n### Dimension 5: Layout (整体布局)\n*   **目标**：引导视觉流向。\n*   **要求**：放弃像素级坐标，转而描述构图逻辑。说明元素之间的层级关系（前景/背景）、堆叠方式以及如何引导观众视线聚焦于核心主体。\n\n## 3. 严格约束 (Strict Constraints)\n1.  **语言限制**：**最终输出必须仅为纯正的英文**。\n2.  **格式清洗**：输出结果中**不包含**任何解释性文字、前言、后记或Markdown代码块标记（如 ```json），仅返回纯文本提示词段落。\n3.  **逻辑连贯**：每个维度的描述必须是连贯的句子，而非简单的关键词堆砌\n\n\n\n\n\n", "Hello", 0.6, 1206, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_baseurl"}, "name": "api_baseurl", "label": "api_baseurl", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_baseurl"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name